{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were just a tourist visiting New Zealand - but now you're  managing an underdog rugby club somehow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone expects you to fail. <i>You've never even played rugby before!</i> But you'll prove them wrong, challenge the champs, and win the Ramphorlie Shield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443270/extras/f3b0da259c6d2692937d2c4f97197b07.poster.avif?t=1752444931\" width=800 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443270/extras/f3b0da259c6d2692937d2c4f97197b07.webm?t=1752444931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443270/extras/f3b0da259c6d2692937d2c4f97197b07.mp4?t=1752444931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TACTICAL TURN-BASED AUTO SPORTS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fresh blend of <strong>tactical RPG</strong>, <strong>auto battler</strong>, and <strong>sports</strong> genres.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the perfect <strong>squad</strong> from 15+ recruitable characters and dozens of skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outsmart</strong> other teams around the city across multiple seasons in a fully featured <strong>story mode.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RUGBY KNOWLEDGE IS OPTIONAL.</strong>\u00a0(It's OK, <i>many rugby players don't know anything about rugby either!)</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443270/extras/2e9f1ea45d117bb55aac4e2c5262581d.avif?t=1752444931\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443270/extras_big/2e9f1ea45d117bb55aac4e2c5262581d.avif?t=1752444931 width=800 height=189 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANAGE A SPORTS CLUB</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for club sponsors and <strong>fundraise</strong> for new equipment. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit</strong>\u00a0new members. You'll need a secretary, treasurer, and patron too.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >File paperwork and <strong>send emails</strong>. Argue with the bank! <i>The possibilities are endless.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443270/extras/3b2bd5e06d88588fd951a3ad3648ef31.poster.avif?t=1752444931\" width=776 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443270/extras/3b2bd5e06d88588fd951a3ad3648ef31.webm?t=1752444931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443270/extras/3b2bd5e06d88588fd951a3ad3648ef31.mp4?t=1752444931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR OWN PATH</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a <strong>branching story</strong> full of love, betrayal, and community sports.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you lose a match, the story mode continues, just like in real-life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443270/extras/f025442fdad4c735298b71fe85912bd4.avif?t=1752444931\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443270/extras_big/f025442fdad4c735298b71fe85912bd4.avif?t=1752444931 width=800 height=218 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LIVE IN VIRTUAL NEW ZEALAND</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage relationships</strong>, gradually earn your players' trust or make them hate you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> an embarrassingly authentic 3D recreation of T\u0101maki Makaurau / Auckland, the 5th largest city in Australasia!*</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(*) as ranked by urban area provisional resident population, June 2024.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443270/extras/a28c4024b6dfb95c202f341e752901d4.avif?t=1752444931\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443270/extras_big/a28c4024b6dfb95c202f341e752901d4.avif?t=1752444931 width=800 height=250 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3443270?t=1752444931","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443270/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752444931","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443270/6c8f1e877770d04c715ecd61431dc10f7c30d74e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752444931","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443270/6c8f1e877770d04c715ecd61431dc10f7c30d74e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752444931","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were just a tourist visiting N